# Brand Identity System

**Mental Model:** Constitutional hierarchy. Foundation rarely changes, everything else evolves.

## Hierarchy of Truth

```
1. foundation/     ← Constitutional. Wins all conflicts.
2. positioning/    ← Strategic. Informs decisions.
3. product/        ← Current reality.
4. voice/          ← Applied. How foundation shows up.
5. research/       ← Evidence. Earns right to change 2-4.
```

## Quick Reference

| Need | Read |
|------|------|
| Voice/tone | `foundation/voice-principles.md` |
| Who we target | `foundation/target-audience.md` |
| What Salt is | `foundation/product-truth.md` |
| Positioning | `positioning/value-proposition.md` |
| Terminology | `voice/terminology.md` (vault only — not in repo) |
