## Quick Identity

- **Brand:** Salt (one word, title case)
- **Domain:** usesalt.io
- **Legal:** Simcoe House Inc. (Delaware C-corp)
- **Voice:** Confident. Strategic. Human. Validating. Calm. (see `foundation/voice-principles.md`)
- **Audience:** Solo service entrepreneurs — independent professionals, $50K-$300K, high-context client work (see `positioning/icp-canonical.md`)
- **Product one-liner:** Proactive AI that learns your business from connected accounts, prepares the work, and you approve what grows (LEARN → ACT → GROW). See `foundation/product-truth.md`.

## Rules

### Foundation (DO NOT modify without approval)
- Cite foundation when explaining brand decisions
- Flag contradictions, don't just change

### Voice
- If `terminology.md` says it, that's how we say it
- Add patterns as they emerge and get approved
- Don't add examples that contradict voice principles

### Product
- Update immediately when features ship
- Keep status indicators accurate: ✅ Shipped | 🚧 Building | 📋 Planned
